  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2021-05-06T14:49:09.247Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I think it may be a great feature for the instant owner to be able to switch the instance version of the world without having to make everyone go through a portal to the new version. \nLets say a group of friends start in an invite only world, and they decided they want to let others in they may not have added, the current solution would be the instance owner would have to add the people then invite them or everyone would have to go through a portal to make a friends+ version which can cause people to get lost/separated or stuck in loading for a while. \nA good solution could be to just have the instance owner switch the world from Invite only to friends+ without having to gather everyone up and leave.",
